rea \nin Colorado.\nSixth  P rincipal  M eridian\nT. 24 S., R. 54 W., \nsec. 31, S&S&;\nT. 25 S., R. 54 W., all;\nT. 26 S., R. 54 W„  \nsec. 3, W &;\nsecs. 4 to 8 and 17 to 20, Inclusive;  \nsec. 30, lot 1 ;\nT. 25 S., R. 55 W.,\nsecs. 1  and 2, and 1 1  to 14, inclusive; \nsec. 22, S%;\nsecs. 23 to 27, inclusiv","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_7670.txt","sha256":"4a5ff73822c14ad5682142c6e28cb7583c1fc2d8647caefe5c941dfc555cc0dc","source":{"line":15,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"f21ac9c2d7e0b4286bb9f535964ad4f8c674e2a04a9696c16b8b26d970c0d775"}}]}
